      <li id="src-4">Sawyer, P. (1982). <em>Kings and Vikings</em>. Routledge. — omen motif as literary convention.</li>
      <li id="src-5">Boarman, W.I. & Heinrich, B. (1999). Common Raven (<em>Corvus corax</em>). <em>Birds of the World</em>. Cornell Lab. — raven following human groups.</li>
    </ol>
